1 NAME Magnus /Svensson Pik/
2 GIVN Magnus
2 _MARNM Svensson Pik
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1397
1 DEAT
2 DATE BET 13 SEP 1461 AND 26 AUG 1462
1 OCCU Väpnare
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Magnus Svensson Pik=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Magnus Pik''', som levde ännu 13.9 1461 men var död 26.8 1462. Denne uppges i släktböcker även ha varit gift med en Bengta Larsdotter. En av Magnus Piks hustrur levde ännu 13.9 1461.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Var redan 24.12 1428 gift med  Ingeborg Knutsdotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Magnus+Pik&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_25287&tab=post SDHK no: 25287]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating:  1448 February 3, Place of issue: Bjursnäs''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT In an open letter, the '''gunner Magnus Pik''' leaves to his 'dear cousin' the knight Ture Jönsson two properties in Västergötland: "Skordatorp" in Murum parish in Ås county and Ljungås in Sveneby parish in Vadsbo county. The issu
2 CONC er waives the right of inheritance he has on behalf of his sister to the properties. She is married to Ragvald Magnusson, who has now legally sold them to Ture Jönsson.
2 CONT The issuer seals.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Post-medieval copies:  Lars Eriksson Sparre's copy book, hs B 16, fol. 178r-v, no. 130, National Archives (SE/RA/0202) image ; prints of B 16 texts, Sv. Dipl. Literature and commentary About Magnus Pik and his sis
2 CONC ter Katarina Svensdotter see KH Karlsson in PHT 1909, p. 19. Regarding her and her husband Ragvald Magnusson (Fargalt) see ÄSF I, p. 31. On the knight Ture Jönsson (Black Scania) see ÄSF I, p. 263.
2 CONT Cf. SDHK no. 25191 , SDHK no. 25399 , SDHK no. 25466 .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Magnus+Pik&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_21095&tab=post SDHK no: 21095]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1428 December 24, Place of issue: Strangnes''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Magnus Pik and his wife Ingeborg Knutsdotter''' confirm Knut Bengtsson's sale of land in "Tiokkatunom i Bergbo" parish to Strängnäs cathedral.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/Sdhk_21095_21095.jpg#?c=&m=&s=&cv=&xywh=-128%2C-271%2C4622%2C3453 '''Sources:'''] Original:  Or. perg. RA 0101  images, Post-medieval copies:  Peringskiöld: E 59:C fol. 8 (reg); Örnhielm: 
2 CONC V p. 765 Post-medieval regest/notice:  B 31 p. 175 RA 0202
2 CONT
