1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Brita Persdotter (Hård af Segerstad)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Peder Olofsson Hård af Segerstad and Karin Tordsdotter Store 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arvid Drake,  married the first time in 1533 with Brita Eriksdotter and gave her it after the father inherited Sunsholmen in the morning gift. Modern having died the same year (or 1534), maybe in a cot, when Märta (dy) was born. H
2 CONC ammers should have been among the farms that were taken to the crown at the so-called church reduction.
2 CONT Märta Arvidsdotter was the sister of Olof Arvidsson (Drake of Intorp), who by that as "one of the old dragons to Hammar ”and was married to the colonel Knut Håkansson Hand, from which among other things the dragon of Hagelsrum der
2 CONC ived
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': 62_drake.doc Gunnar Tonnquist
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Adelsvapen-Wiki==
2 CONT
2 CONT Hård af Segerstad nr 17, Adliga ätten Hård af Segerstad nr 17 - https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003805986118?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000097133278964&position=0
2 CONT
2 CONT Old Frälsesläkt. Introd. 1625. Promoted in the Knight Class 1650. Pure Agnatiskt Way is the ancestor Jöns Erlandsson (Liljesparre) who may have had a sparre or Liljesparre weapon. Naamnet hard is derived from Johan "Joen" hard (Sp
2 CONC arre) known 1424 who was the grandfather of Gunnil Laurensdotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Tab 5
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Peder Hård (son of Olof Pedersson, tab 4).''' Squire. Already referred to as 1501, when he, after his father, acted as a party to a case law on the estate Landbotorp in Håksviks parish. Bring two crossbones like shield marks. D
2 CONC ied in Stockholm around 1534 (after 1532-06-24). Married to '''Carin Tordsdotter, daughter of her husband Tord Björnsson ( Store ) and Kerstin Bengtsdotter Crab'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriages==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married ( 1)  in 1533 to '''Brita Eriksdotter,'''
2 CONT * Married (2) ''' Brita Persdotter (Hård af Segerstad),''' daughter of the gunner Peder Hård and Carin Tordsdotter ( Store ).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Märta Arvidsdotter,''' died in 1606, married about 1550 to Field Colonel Knut Håkansson ( Hand ).
2 CONT * '''Agneta Arvidsdotter,''' married before 1562 with the commander at Gullberg Peder
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' Dragon from Västbo - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Drake_fr%C3%A5n_V%C3%A4stbo
2 CONT
