2 CONC ary See SDHK no. 12528 and SDHK no. 12527 (1383 1/12). Cf. H. Rosman, Bjärka-Säby I, p. 188 and 244 [before 1/12]. Cf. G. Lundberg, Bälinge parish during the Middle Ages, 1976, p. 38. See also CI Ståhle, Lidingö during antiquity a
2 CONC nd the Middle Ages, in the Ortnamssällskapet's i Uppsala yearbook 1954, p. 4 et seq. See SDHK no. 12528 and SDHK no. 12527 (1383 1/12).
