2 CONT Holy Birgitta Birgersdtr Finnstad
2 CONT
2 CONT Den hellige Birgitta Birgersdtr Finnstad
2 CONT
2 CONT Holy Birgitta Birgersdtr Finnstad was born in 1303 that is built, Uppland, Sweden. She married Ridder Ulf Gudmarsen Ulvåsa, son of Gudme Magnussen Hjorthofud and Margareta Ulfsdtr Lejon Sweden, circa 1316. She died in 1373 at Nærk
2 CONC e, Sweden. She Birgitta took weapons marked by his mother's ancestry Lejon = Løve which she believed was finer than farsætta And. She founded monastery. 
