2 CONT Marta Ulfsdtr Sweden was born circa 1319 at Sweden. She married Sigvid Knutson Ribbing circa 1345. She married Knut Algotsen IX Lejon Folkunge, son of Algot Brynjulfsen Lejon and Kristina Tolvesdtr Sweden, in 1355 at Sweden. She d
2 CONC ied before 1375 at Norway
