1 NOTE {geni:about_me} = Peter Andersson Prika, i Möne=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Anders Prika, i Gällstad and NN
2 CONT * Född:	cirka 1350 Gällstad, Västergötland, Sverige (Sweden) 
2 CONT * Sköld: I fält en sexuddig stjärna
2 CONT * Död:	cirka 1413 (54-72) Möne, Västergötland, Sverige (Sweden) 
2 CONT * Yrke:	Väpnare 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897563080&photo_id=6000000176265083907&position=0 '''Geneology of Prika | Anbytarforum''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Ingeborg Sigvidsdotter Ribbing''' Daughter of Sigvid Sigvidsson Ribbing and Märta Ulfsdotter (Ulvåsa) 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Peter Andersson Prika (stjärna) =
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Ingegerd (Pedersdotter) Prika''' Birth:	1380 in Gällstad, Västergötland & died before 1438, in Västergötland, Sverige (Sweden). Married Arvid Jönsson (Sparre över Stjärna). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=SDHK+17835&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_17835&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''17835''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1412 May 26'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Märta Larsdotter gives Mr. Gunne Prika, Peter Andersson and others. receipt of the inheritance that went to her after her brother Peter Prika and Peter Eriksson. SEAL N. 1. En sparre (?) Med omskr .: s. Jonis bencts; N. 2. En spar
2 CONC re med omskr .: s. Arvidi jonsson; N. 3. En sparre med omskr .: s. Magnvs abe
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Prika&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=4&postid=sdhk_13686&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''13686''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1390 February 13'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Open'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter Nilsson and his wife Elin "Deyia" pledge to Tove Benosson's estate in Nittorp (s parish, Kinds district) for 30 marks of money in oxen and cows to be handed over next Johannesdag (midsummer). As the issuers do not have a sea
2 CONC l, the honest and well-to-do men ask Peter Ribbing, Peter Prika, Jöns Bengtsson and Magnus Nilsson to seal. Literature and commentary.  The parchment is partially damaged by moisture and difficult to read. If the sailors see ang. 
2 CONC Peter (Assarsson) Ribbing A. Mohlin in PHT 1957, p. 81, ang. Peter Prika J. Liedgren in PHT 1964, p. 171. Magnus Nilsson's seal shows a chevron. Possibly he is identical to Magnus Hake; cf. SDHK no. 11015 , where Magnus Hake issue
2 CONC s and seals together with a Karl Nilsson with a similar coat of arms.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK-nr: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Prika&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=5&postid=sdhk_17958&tab=post#tab '''17958''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1413 February 10'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Solder''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Sigvidsdotter, widow of Peter Prika , sells to rd Algot Magnusson his manor Torpa, seven farms in Flundrevalla, a mill and two mill streams in Fors sn, a mill stream in "Syundafors" and farms in Anstorp (?; Austhenstorpp)
2 CONC  in Rommeleds sn, Flundre hd, Gammanstorp, Huvudnäs (Hughanæs) in Vassända sn, Väne hd, Tillhagen in Bolstads sn, Lånstorp (in Bolstads parish) and "Vluidhathorpp" in Grinstads sn on Dal, three farms in Björketorp in Surteby sn an
2 CONC d one in Kattunge in Kattunge sn, Marks hd. SEAL No. 1 Three downward-facing lake leaves with rewrite: ingeborgh sivitsdot .; No. 2 Bishop Brynolfs; No. 3 Gustav Magnussons (cf. SDHK No. 15552 , seal No. 2); No. 4 Torsten Simonsso
2 CONC ns (cf. SDHK no. 15541 , seal no. 4).
2 CONT
2 CONT https://forum.rotter.se/index.php?topic=67049.0
