1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Iliana Åkesdotter (Tott)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: Tord Bonde (son of Karl Bonde, Tab. 8 ), to Penningby. Born around 1420, died in 1456. Murdered with an ax by his own Danish servant Jösse Bosson . Stands hold a part of Norway and Västergötland. Hövidsman at Axvalla Ca
2 CONC stle. Riksmarsk. Knight. Married 1455-02-23 in Vadstena with Iliana Åkesdotter , daughter of the Danish National Council and the knight Åke Axelsson ( Tott ) and Märta Bengtsdotter ( Vinstorpaätten ).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birgitta Tordsdotter, born around 1456. Married 1: o by 1474 with the knight and riksrådet Johan Kristersson ( Vasa ). Married 2: o with the knight and the Erik Ottosson council (three bear frames).
2 CONT
