2 CONC hould afcop") and B 9 fol. 102V. RA 0202. (See registrant with commentary by L. Svabe, Transcripts IB 2 and B 9, RA concerning the Vaasa family. Diar. 1974 / no. 228. Located in registrant above B 9).
