1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Cristina Jonsdotter (Rickebyätten)=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Jon Nilsson Stierna (Rickeby) and Märta Sunesdotter (Bååt) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Royal Family of Vaasa=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Kettilsson to Björnö , † after 1378. Lordship in Frötuna. (black straw vase in yellow field). King bailiff and official at Stockholm Castle in 1354 and 1355. In 1371 and 1376 he was called King Albrecht's adviser in Sweden. '
2 CONC ''Married before 1369 with Cristina Jonsdotter,''' † after 1378. Daughter of the knight Jon Nilsson Rickebyätten (seven-edged white star in blue and red field) and Märta Båth who was the daughter of Sune Joensson to Flishult .
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Ramborg Nilsdotter,''' married before 1376 with the knight and the national council Tord Röriksson Bonde , † 1417-03-21 and buried in Vadstena monastery. Grandmother to King Karl Knutsson Farmer .
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Nilsdotter,''' Nun in St. Klara Kloster / A.
2 CONT * '''Christiern Nilsson,''' born 1365, died 1442-04-29 at Viborg Castle and was buried so. June 29 in Stockholm's gray brothers convent. Chief white man at Viborg. Knights, national council and drots. Married 1st with Margareta Jo
2 CONC hansdotter , † in Uppsala and buried 1413-08-07 in Vadstena monastery. Daughter of the knight Johan Moltke and Katarina Glysingsdotter . Married 2nd: 1426 to Margareta Eriksdotter born 1390, † 1451-06-09 and was buried in Gråbrödr
2 CONC aklostret in Stockholm, in her 2nd marriage . Her 1st marriage to Ture Stensson Bielke . Daughter of the Danish National Council Erik Krummedigeand Beata von Thienen 
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Vasa#TAB_8 '''Source'''  Vasa Nobility]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Swedish Diplomatarium's Main Directory of Medieval Letters=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sdhk?EndastDigitaliserat=false&Innehall=rickeby&TrycktUtgava=true&TrycktRegest=true&Brevtext=true&Extratext=true&Sigill=true&Original=true&MedeltidaAvskrifter=true&MedeltidaRegest=true&Eftermedeltida
2 CONC Avskrifter=true&EftermedeltidaRegest=true&AvanceradSok=False&page=2&postid=sdhk_2715&tab=post#tab SDHK No: 2715]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1316 February 2, of issue Rickeby''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Jonsson and his wife Kristina in Rickeby draw up wills. They give the priest in Vidbo church 14 Öresland land in Bista (Vidbo parish, Seminghundra hierad) as well as the "Ragnotegher" mountains for holding certain fairs; 2 tr
2 CONC out land in the same village for the celebration of the Virgin Mary's birth celebration and 2 trout land there for annual alms; to the same priest they also donate 10 marks of silver for the purchase of livestock and maintenance o
2 CONC f the goods. The witnesses were Nils Kristinasson, Kanik in Uppsala, Lars in Ringbohärad, Nils, priest, Erik Kristiernsson, Ragnerus Stallari, Peter Sigridsson, Ragvald Petersson, Enar Håkanson, Nils Upplänning, Tjälve and Magnus,
2 CONC  his brother in Krokesta, Peter Ingmarsson and Johannes there, Nils Jerundason and Nils Suarti in Bista, Elavus, Karl and Ingvar in Karlaby, Peter by Berby, Ragvald, Hemming and Jerundus in Åsby. Olof, elected and consecrated Arch
2 CONC bishop of Uppsala,
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/2715.pdf  '''Seal: The issuers, Nils Kristinason, Lars of Ringbohärad, Kettil Jonsson, Erik Kristiernsson, Ragnar Stallara, Enar Håkansson.'''] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sdhk?EndastDigitaliserat=false&SDHK=+10865&TrycktUtgava=true&TrycktRegest=true&Brevtext=true&Extratext=true&Sigill=true&Original=true&MedeltidaAvskrifter=true&MedeltidaRegest=true&EftermedeltidaAvskri
2 CONC fter=true&EftermedeltidaRegest=true&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_10865&tab=post#tab SDHK No: 10865]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1376 September 10, of issue: Stockholm'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses,  Nils Kettilsson and Kristina Jonsdotter donate with their daughter Ingeborg, which was filed in St. Klara monastery in Stockholm, 1 land in Forsa in Tensta parish to the monastery.  The issuers, together with Archbishop 
2 CONC Birger (Gregersson) in Uppsala.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/10865.pdf '''Seal:  The Knight Karl (Ulfsson), the lord Bo Jonsson and Tord (Röriksson) Bonde, the son-in-law of the issuers.''']
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sdhk?EndastDigitaliserat=false&SDHK=10888&TrycktUtgava=true&TrycktRegest=true&Brevtext=true&Extratext=true&Sigill=true&Original=true&MedeltidaAvskrifter=true&MedeltidaRegest=true&EftermedeltidaAvskrif
2 CONC ter=true&EftermedeltidaRegest=true&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_10888&tab=post#tab SDHK No: 10888]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1376 October 9, of issue: Nykoping'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Issuer: Spouses,  Nils Kettilsson and Kristina Jonsdotter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Kettilsson, together with his wife Kristin Jonsdotter, transfers to his brother Tord Bonde and his wife Ramborg, the daughters of the issuers, and both of them heirs 13 öresland land in Norsa in Norrsunda parish, 13 öresland 
2 CONC land in Skalmsta in Skånela parish, 12 Öresland land in Norr Vidbo parish, 9 öesland land in Bergby in the same parish and 4 1/2 herb land in Rävsta in St. Olof's parish (later in Odensala parish) in Sigtuna for 150 marks of solde
2 CONC red silver, which Tord Bonde paid in full. After this date, no heirs of the issuer shall be able to exchange or revoke these properties, or any part thereof, provided that Tord Bonde and his wife Ramborg do not repay the silver su
2 CONC m paid within six months after the goods have been blamed. Kristin Jonsdotter specifically certifies that she approves the sale because the properties are her real father. The issuers further provide district governors and county 
2 CONC officials (in the areas) where the land is authorized to give their powers to Tord Bonde or his agent fixed on the properties in accordance with national law.  
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000000735972498&photo_id=6000000139799432837&position=0 '''The guards seal together with the knight Karl Ulfsson of Tofta and Bo Jonsson, throughout Sweden.''']
2 CONT
2 CONT Utfärdarna beseglar tillsammans med riddaren [https://www.geni.com/people/Karl-Ulfsson-Sparre-av-Tofta/6000000000346040605 Karl Ulfsson av Tofta] och [https://www.geni.com/people/Bo-Grip/6000000003340396483 Bo Jonsson], drots i Sv
2 CONC erige.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sdhk?EndastDigitaliserat=false&SDHK=11301&TrycktUtgava=true&TrycktRegest=true&Brevtext=true&Extratext=true&Sigill=true&Original=true&MedeltidaAvskrifter=true&MedeltidaRegest=true&EftermedeltidaAvskrif
2 CONC ter=true&EftermedeltidaRegest=true&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_11301&tab=post#tab SDHK No: 11301]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1378 September 8, of issue: Raasepori'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Tord Bonde acknowledges in an open letter that he received from Nils Kettilsson and his wife Kristina Jonsdotter 13 Öresland land in Norsa in Norrsunda parish, 13 Öresland land in Skalmsta in Skånela parish, 12 Öresland land in No
2 CONC rrby in Vidbo parish, 9 Öresland land in Bergby in the same parish and 4 ½ herb land in Räfsta in St. Olofs parish in Sigtuna as compensation for a debt of 150 marks of soldered silver. The properties have been leased in accordanc
2 CONC e with the national law, and Tord has the spouses' open letter (DS no. 9337) thereon. He now hands over the property to his wife Ramborg. For the event Ramborg childless survives her husband, these properties must be hers. If, on 
2 CONC the other hand, she dies childless before her husband, they return, without the possibility of repurchase, to Nils Kettilsson and his wife Kristina, for the great love and goodwill that they have shown the issuer and which he stil
2 CONC l hopes for. The issuer seals together with the knight Erengisle Nilsson. - https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000000735972498?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000139804244821
2 CONT
2 CONT Utfärdaren beseglar tillsammans med riddaren [https://www.geni.com/people/Erengisle-Nilsson-Hammersta/6000000003734498678 Erengisle Nilsson]. (Gift med Kristina Röriksdotter Bonde syster till Tord Röriksson Bonde)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sdhk?EndastDigitaliserat=false&SDHK=11322&TrycktUtgava=true&TrycktRegest=true&Brevtext=true&Extratext=true&Sigill=true&Original=true&MedeltidaAvskrifter=true&MedeltidaRegest=true&EftermedeltidaAvskrif
2 CONC ter=true&EftermedeltidaRegest=true&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_11322&tab=post#tab SDHK No: 11322]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1378 October 24, Issuer: Nils Kettilsson (Vaasa) and his wife Kristin Jonsdotter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Kettilsson and Kristina Jonsdotter give their servant Olof Lammfot 12 öresland land with, among other things, mills and mill streams in Vallby in the Rimbo parish in Seven Hundred with full ownership. If Olof dies childless, 
2 CONC the property returns to Nils and Kristin's heirs, but if Olof has children, the property becomes their inheritance. The issuers authorize the district governor and the county clerk in the same hardened authority to give to Olof or
2 CONC  his representative the property under the national law.  
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000000735972498?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000139810055821 '''The issuers seal together with Nils Petersson in Länna.''']
2 CONT
