1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birgitta Tordsdotter Bonde==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Johan Christiernsson  Married 2: o by 1474 with Birgitta Tordsdotter Bonde born about 1456, lived in 1520 when she, as widow, had Penningby in Länna / C as sätesgård. in her 1st wedding . 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 2nd married the knight and Erik Ottesson Björnram from Västergötland , † probably 1495. Daughter of the marsh Tord Karlsson Bonde and Elin / Iliana Åkesdotter Tott
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Johan Christiernsson==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Anna Johansdotter , † 1506 and buried in Vadstena. Married before 1498 with the knight and the council Ture Jönsson Three roses
2 CONT
2 CONT Vasa Geneology, Adelsvapen Tab 5 - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Vasa
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father Tord Bonde (son of Karl Bonde, Tab. 8 ), to Penningby. Born around 1420, died in 1456. Murdered with an ax by his own Danish servant Jösse Bosson . Stands hold a part of Norway and Västergötland. Hövidsman at Axvalla Cast
2 CONC le. Riksmarsk. Knight. Married 1455-02-23 in Vadstena with Iliana Åkesdotter , daughter of the Danish National Council and the knight Åke Axelsson ( Tott ) and Märta Bengtsdotter ( Vinstorpaätten ).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birgitta Tordsdotter, born around 1456. Married 1: o by 1474 with the knight and riksrådet Johan Kristersson ( Vasa ). Married 2: o with the knight and the Erik Ottosson council (three bear frames).
2 CONT
2 CONT Farmer No. 11, Adelsvapen - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bonde_nr_11
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links==
