1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Christina Håkansdotter af Wangaslagten=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Håkan Svensson (Bölja eller Stomfelt) and Anna Karlsdotter (Bonde) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Peder Pedderson, till Hagalsrum,''' Son of Peder Hakansson, till Hagelsrum and Carin Gustafsdotter.  Anna Karlsdotter (Bonde), married to the nobleman Håkan Svensson (Bölja), governor of Västerås castle.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Håkan Pedersson,''' Håkan Persson , died about 1531, married 1st before 1514 with Kerstin Håkansdotter (Tun) , daughter of the gunner Håkan Karlsson Tun and Ingrid Knutsdotter ( spar over star ).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source'''  Adelsvapen Hand nr #59 - http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Hand_nr_59
2 CONT
