1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Olof Nilsson (stjärna), born approximately around 1420 or earlier, lived in Kniva, Vika parish, Dalarna county, Sweden. His three sons are mentioned in 1473. At least two of them are verified to belong to Y-DNA hap
2 CONC lo group R1a1a1b1a2b3 (CTS3402), subgroup  R-JN80. 
