2 CONT * https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=17618
2 CONT * https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Drake_fr%C3%A5n_V%C3%A4stbo#TAB_5
2 CONT * http://www.tonnquist.se/fam/-cd-/drake.pdf
2 CONT * https://familypedia.wikia.org/wiki/Sm%C3%A5land
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
