2 CONT
2 CONT Husband 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peder Gudleiksen Y. Eide 1260 - 1300
2 CONT
2 CONT Son 
2 CONT
2 CONT Augustinus Pedersson VEREIDE 1292 - 1392
2 CONT
2 CONT Son Bård Pedersen Vereide 1294 -
2 CONT
2 CONT Son 
2 CONT
2 CONT Serk Pedersen Vereide 1295 -
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter 
2 CONT
2 CONT Åsa Pedersdatter Vereide 1296 -
2 CONT
