2 CONT
2 CONT Gudmar Magnussen Hjorthofud married Margareta Ulfsdotter Lejon Sweden, daughter of Ulf Carlsen. He was born before 1280 at Göteland vestre, Sweden. He died at Göteland vestre, Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margareta Ulfsdtr Lejon Sweden married Gudmar Magnussen Hjorthofud. She married Algot Brynjulfsen Lejon, son of Brynjulf ​​Bengtsen Lejon Gotland and Ingegerd Svantepolksdotter Sweden. She was born before 1280 at Sweden. She died 
2 CONC at Vest Gutland, Sweden. She is from the Finnstad family. (She is built of ancestry.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Team man in Western Gothenburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT A knight named Gudmar Magnusson (also Månsson) stood in 1312 as owner of Loholm and Loo. He was married to Margareta Ulfsdotter of Bjälboätten, dead before 1341, and probably it was Margareta who brought Loholm into the marriage. 
2 CONC Margaret's family in ascending line were on the sword side Ulf Karlsson, Karl Karlsson and Karl döve who were the uncle of teammate Eskil Magnusson - thus Bjälboätten, see at the bottom of the family's pedigree. Together they had 
2 CONC the children Ulf, Magnus and their daughter Katarina who were married to the knight Gustav Tunesson to Fagranäs. Gudmar (earliest mentioned in 1289 and 1291) was a lawman in Västergötland, referred to as such in 1312. He also stan
2 CONC ds as Ulvåsaät's ancestor. Possibly Gudmar was born on Ulvåsa, which was a family estate, died after 1313. Gudmar also owned Tuna in Närke who later passed on to son Ulf Gudmarsson, who in conjunction with this took up the lion in
2 CONC  his coat of arms - see it on the Bjälboättens pedigree. Ulf was married to Saint Birgitta. http://www.wadbring.com/historia/sidor/loholm.htm#gudmar
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Gudmar Magnusson. Oli ritari vuonna 1291 ja Linköpingin arkkidiakoni Sigtrygg mainitsi hänen nimensä sinetöidessään testamenttinsa. Oli kuningas Birgerin neuvonantaja vuonna 1299 ja uudelleen vuonna 1305, mutta herttuoiden Erikin 
2 CONC ja Valdemarin ritari vuonna 1307 ja neuvonantaja vuonna 1312. Oli lainvalvoja Länsi-Götanmaalla vuonna 1312 ja hänet mainitaan viimeksi 26.8.1313. Hän meni naimisiin vuonna 1291 Margareta Ulfsdotterin kanssa, joka oli Ulf Karlsson
2 CONC in tytär ja ritari-neuvos Karl Ulfssonin (leijona) sisar. Häntä kutsuttiin tuolloin Linköpingin arkkidiakoni Sigtryggin "neptis":ksi ja hän kuoli vuonna 1341.
