2 CONT * Ramborg Israelsdotter became 1) m Filip Nilsson (troll Sparre of Tofta) and 2) m knight, the national council and the lawyer Anund Jonsson (Lion's face). - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/Sbl/Mobil/Artikel/14142
2 CONT *  The medieval Upplands-Bro, From the Medieval Sweden - 1: 7 Attundaland Bro hurray Published by the National Heritage Board in 1992, page 25 - http://www.ukforsk.se/dms_mantal/DMS_bro_nas.pd
2 CONT * Personal Record for Anund Algotsson Sture, Born 1380 Toresund, Södermanland" . mikaelhardselius.ownit.nu . Archived from the original on January 30, 2016 . Last January 23, 2016.
