2 CONC  and ÄSF I, p. 47. About the sons Magnus and Johan Trottesson and the gulls Lars Björnsson, Tideke Pinnow and Kort Görtz, see ÄSF I, p. 224. For this part of Ekaätten, see also E. Nordström in PHT 1941-1942, p. 17 ff. About Lars B
2 CONC jörnsson see also SRM p. 57.
