2 CONT * The transcript of the letter text has obvious formal flaws. Among other things, the pronoun "warä" ("spring") (r. 3) should only refer to Ingegerd. Another example is the subsequent phrase about the husband's consent ("medh mys 
2 CONC husboändä gotwiljä ok kärärelse", not included in the regiment) which is superfluous since he is one of the letter's issuer.
