1 NAME Anders Jacobsen /Jakobsen Lunge/
2 GIVN Anders Jacobsen
2 SURN Jakobsen Lunge
2 _MARNM Lunge
1 NAME Anders Jacobsen Lunge
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1363
