2 CONC  daughters name Adelus, probably named after Torleiv wife. Mr. Anders, therefore, in which an older [half] brother of Torleiv Benkestok. Torleiv title, velboren man, pas he could be a descendant by Jon Tordsson Benkestok in 1435, 
