2 CONT
2 CONT '''By 1st marriage'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.1. '''Kristiern Johansson (Vasa)''' (died before 1497) Married Dorothea Knutsdotter (Baner), daughter of Knut Eskilsson (Baner) (died after 1527)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.1.1.'''Gustaf Kristiernsson (Vasa)''' (mentioned 1504 and 1513)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.1.2.'''Birgitta Kristiernsdotter (Vasa)''' (mentioned 1526 and 1566) Married (1) 1525 Diedrik (died 1527) Married (2) after 1531 Mats Persson (died ca.1553)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.2. '''Erik Johansson (Vasa)''' (born 1470 - died 8 November 1520 Stockholm (beheaded)) Married Cecilia Mansdotter (Ekaatten), daughter of Magnus Carlsson pa Eka and Sigrid Eskilsdotter (Baner) pa Lindholmen (died ca.1523)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.2.1.'''Birgitta (Vasa)''' (died young)
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.2.2.'''Gustaf I Eriksson King of Sweden''' 1523-1560 (born 12 May 1496 Lindholmen - died 29 September 1560 Stockholm) Married (1) 24 September 1531 Stockholm Princess Catharina of Saxe-Lauenburg, daughter of Magnus I, Duke o
2 CONC f Saxe-Lauenburg 1507-1543 and Duchess Katharina of Brunswick-Wolfenbuttel (born 1513 (Ratzeburg?) - died 23 September 1535 Stockholm) Married (2) 1 October 1536 Upsala Margaretha Leijonhufvud, daughter of Erik Abrahamsson Leijonh
2 CONC ufvud pa Loholmen, Governor of Westergotland and Ebba Eriksdotter (Vasa) (born 1 January 1514 Ekeberg - died 26 August 1551 Tynnelso) Married (3) 22 August 1552 Wadstena Catharina Stenbock, daughter of Gustaf Olofsson, Friherre St
2 CONC enbock and Brita Eriksdotter Leijonhufvud (born 22 July 1535 - died 13 December 1621)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''By 1st marriage'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.3.2.2.1.'''Eric XIV King of Sweden''' 1560-1568 (born 13 December 1533 - died 26 February 1577) Married 4 July 1568 Katharine Maansdotter (born 6 November 1550 - died 13 September 1612)
2 CONT
