2 CONT * 3.3.2.2.1.5.'''Sigrid Eriksdotter''' (born 16 October 1566) Married (1) 1597 Henrik Tott (died 1602/3) Married (2) 10 June 1609 Niels Natt och Dag (born 1554 - died 12 April 1613)
