2 CONC ustria and Princess Marie of Bavaria (born 16 August 1573 Graz - died 10 February 1598 Krakow) Married (2) 11 December 1605 Archduchess Constantia of Austria, daughter of Archduke Karl of Austria and Princess Marie of Bavaria (bor
2 CONC n 24 December 1588 - died 10 July 1631 Krakow)
