2 CONC 37 and Princess Maria Anna of Bavaria (born 16 July 1611 Gratz - died 24 March 1644 Vilna, buried Krakau) Married (2) 10 March 1646 Louise Maria Gonzaga, daughter of Carlo I Gonzaga, Duke of Mantua, Rethel and Nevers and Catherine
