2 CONT '''Gift med''' [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Roos_af_Hjelms%C3%A4ter_nr_51#TAB_82 '''Erik Gustafsson, till Hjelmsäter''' (Roos af Hjelmsäter)], död 1582.
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT Family - Kerstin Eriksdotter (dead 1509), Hans Åkesson (Tott); their daughter Karin Hansdotter married Harald Knutsson Soop and their daughter Märta Haraldsdotter Soop married in turn with Erik Gustafsson Roos of Hjelmsäter.
2 CONT
