1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Helga Bengtsdotter (Vingad pil)==
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vingad_pil '''Helga Bengtsdotter''' (Vingad pil)] (- 1393), Hon var först gift med tiohäradslagmannen [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sune_Jonsson_(B%C3%A5%C3%A5t%29 '''Sune Jonsson''' (Båt)], av [htt
2 CONC ps://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erengisle_Sunesson_(B%C3%A5%C3%A5t%29 Erengisle Sunessons] ätt, äktenskapet var barnlöst. Änka åtminstone sedan 12 oktober 1339 . Andra gången gift 1350 med [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnus_Knutsson
2 CONC _(Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten%29 '''Magnus Knutsson''' (Aspenäs)].
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Helga Bengtsdotter''', who was the daughter of Bengt Elofsson, according to A. F. Liljeholm obviously Birger Earl's nephew (Brunkow).
2 CONT * Helga Bengtsson, died 1393, was a Swedish landowners. She was the daughter of Bengt Eales (winged arrow). She was first married to Tiohäradslagmannen Sune Jonsson (boat), by Erengisle Sunessons . Widow at least since 12 october 
2 CONC 1339.
2 CONT * Burial: January 8, 1393 in Vadstena Monastery.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriages==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Married: (1) Sune Jonsson Boat in 1339'''; Was Knight 1315-09-09 when he participated in the so-called hävdaskiftet between the Dukes Erik and Valdemar, and Privy Councilor 1319-07-28. Participated in the Skara Association 13
2 CONC 22-07-20. He was bailiff at Kalmar Castle 1329-02-02 and Lawspeaker in Tiohärads Lagsaga 1337-01-13, when he pawned all his goods in Vedbo hundred to security for 200 mark, which he borrowed from Bishop Karl in Linköping. Also own
2 CONC ed goods in Alsheda in Njudung. Died before 1339-10-12. He played, like his brother Peter Jonsson, a prominent role in the regain of Viborg 1321 and participated at Skånes seizure. 1332. married 1: o with Karin Henriksdotter, daug
2 CONC hter Of the knight Henrik Glysing. '''Married 2: o with Helga Bengtsson (winged arrow), in her 1st married.'''
2 CONT * '''Married (2) Magnus Knutsson (Aspenäsätten) in 1350'''.  Son of Knut Jonsson.   First appeared 17.5 1335. Knight became some of the years 1336 — 1340, probably by King Magnus Coronation 21.7 1336. Was vicelagman in Östergötlan
2 CONC d 1340. Board as a Privy Council only in a letter of year 1351 and then together with several persons, who also only mentioned as a Privy councilor. Was lawspeaker in Östergötland 1347 and even 1363. Would have been deprived of hi
2 CONC s lagmans dignity in connection with King Albrekts of Mecklenburg enthronement, since Nils Jonsson (Rickebyätten) 22.8 1364 called himself Östgötalagman. Is 6.2 1366 again lawspeaker in Östergötland, when he also the last time app
2 CONC ear as alive. Was probably dead 6.7 1366, because Bo Jonsson (Grip) was then Östgötalagman. Be sure dead 1369. He and his brothers Fråntogo's: Take clear monasteries in Stockholm Earth in Långhundra, Trögds and Vaksala HD in Uppla
2 CONC nd, which their father Knut Jonsson 1333 had given to the monastery with their sister Ingeborg. King Magnus Eriksson awarded the 1348 monastery this earth until further investigation has been done about the matter. Was 24.11 1350 
2 CONC married to '''Helga Bengtsson''', who was the daughter of Bengt Eales, according to A. F. Labra obviously Birger Jarl's nephew (Brunkow Ekeby), and widow at least since 12.10 1339 after Tiohäradslagmannen Sune Jonsson (boat, Ereng
2 CONC isl Sunasons). Begrossed 8.1 1393 in Vadstena monastery. She received from Sune Jonsson Earth tomorrow's gift in ash HD in Östergötland, which she, when the marriage was childless, donated to Vadstena monastery and got after him s
2 CONC oil in eastern HD in Småland and owned in other soil in S. Vedbo and Western HD in the same landscape , as well as in Ash, Dals and Valkebo HD in Östergötland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Magnus Knutsson ==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Katarina Magnus ' daughter'''. Lived even 24.8 1393. Got at the inheritance shift after his father Ekolsund in Husby-Sjutolfts SN in Trögds HD in Uppland and all his goods in Uppsala bishopric. She changed her soil in norther
2 CONC n Vedbo HD in Småland. Owned Earth in Färentuna HD and Danderyds SKPLG in Uppland. Was 1.9 1373 married to the Privy Council Finvid Finvidsson (Frössviksätten), which appeared in the sources 1351 — 1378 and was previously married 
2 CONC to a daughter of Gustav Arvidsson (Sparre of Vik).
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Magnus ' daughter'''. Was dead 6.12 1389. Inherited Tranås in Säby sn in Norra Vedbo HD in Småland and moved to Earth in the same HD. was married to Magnus Karlsson (örnfot), which occurs 1355 — 1362.
2 CONT * '''Birgitta Magnus ' daughter'''. Lived yet 28.8 1398 but begrossed 7.9 s. Å in Vadstena monastery. Inherited Edshult in Likanämnd sn in southern Vedbo HD in Småland. Was first married to Mils VII (stump), who died before 1369. 
2 CONC Was 27.3 1379 remarried with the Knight Mats Gustavsson (Sparre, Mats Gustavsson), then this Pansatte gods, who belonged to Nils VII. Mr Mats appeared 1374 in connection with the slaying of Linköpingsbiskopen Gotskalk and the Bero
2 CONC ughs 1419. He was 11.6 1410 remarried with Birgitta, daughter of Halsten Petersson (boat) and Katarina Svensdotter (Sparre). Mrs. Birgitta Hal Sten's daughter became after Mr. Mats ' death remarried with Nils Jonsson (Bååt), who f
2 CONC irst appeared in 15.3 1435, the last time 14.8 1440 and was mentioned death (beaten) 7.1 1441, when the wife lived widowed after him.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' adelsvapen, Aspenäsätten - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten#TAB_4
2 CONT
2 CONT == Helga Bengtsdotter (winged arrow), Wikipedia==
2 CONT
2 CONT Helga Bengtsdotter , died in 1393, was a Swedish landowner. She was the daughter of Bengt Elofsson (winged arrow) . She was first married to ten-army batsman Sune Jonsson (Boat) , of Erengisle Sunesson's lineage. Widow at least si
2 CONC nce October 12, 1339 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Helga Bengtsdotter received from Sune Jonsson land in a morning gift in Ashland in Östergötland , which she, when the marriage was childless, donated to Vadstena monastery and received land in Östra hered in Småland and owned othe
2 CONC r land in Södra Vedbo hered and Västra hered in the same landscape, as well as in Aska, Dals and Valkebo, in Östergötland.
2 CONT
2 CONT The donation letter was sealed by the issuer as well as the knights Earl Erengisle Sunesson , Karl Ulfsson by Tofta , the team in Uppland, Bengt Filipsson , Birger Ulfsson and Sten Bengtsson .
2 CONT
2 CONT The second time married in 1350 to Magnus Knutsson (Aspenäsätt) .
2 CONT
2 CONT She was buried January 8, 1393 in Vadstena Monastery.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source'''- https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helga_Bengtsdotter_(vingad_pil)
2 CONT
