2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1448 February 23'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: (Soldering nozzle)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003645811238?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000191744341823 '''Karl Lake 's deed of exchange with Magnus Torbersson, mayor of Lödöse, who gets a farm in Lekåsa for a farm in Eline.''']
2 CONT
