2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Karl Haraldsson Lake and Cecilia Torbjörnsdotter (gumsehuvud)
2 CONT *  1452 Malma southeast of Grästorp with Nossan in the southwest and Kedumsbergen in the east, Västergötland, Died after 1497 1) (Probably in Västra Götaland county, Vara municipality, Sparlösa parish).
2 CONT * Ingrid Karlsdotter . Married to the squire and district governor of Asa district Bengt Björnsson (sparre), died after 1497, to Ulvstorp in Sparlösa parish, Skaraborg county, which property he already owned in 1483. The daughter 
2 CONC Cecilia Bengtsdotter was reportedly married to Peder Svenske .
2 CONT
