2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Lindorm Andersson. Born in Rottne, Söraby (G).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT *Married:  '''Håkan Matsson Båt av Billa''' Died 1534 in Billa, Hemmesjö with Tegnaby (G).
2 CONT
