2 CONT * Married: '''Ingrid Knutsdotter,''' (Also called Ingegärd) was married to the [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000006127473921&photo_id=6000000174835225899&position=0 '''Gunman Håkan Karlsson Tun,''
2 CONC '] son of Karl Tun.
