2 CONT Örboholm, a salvation manor af 1 mtl, uti WesterLjungs socken af Hölebo härad and Nyköpings län, l'/4 mil from Trosa, 45/g mil from Nyköping, on V4 mils distance from a bay af Saltsjön, at Giseån, in a wooded and mountainous area.
2 CONC  — The place is called in older land records Gammalgård and is one of the oldest manors in the locality; was a manor already in 1407, when it was inhabited by the squire Heurik Niklison, who participated in the war against the Hol
2 CONC steinarne during the cow. Erik's time, in the 1500s belonged to the Privy Councillors Jakob and Nils Krumrae, was inherited by his maternal grandmother, Thomas Jönssons till Gesterby enka, wife Karin Gödicks-dotter (Finke), who ac
2 CONC cording to a barter letter. on 28 June 1574, Örboholms gård with subordinates, such as »Grönsöö, Skiallberga» m. m., in WesterLjung, and ströhemmau in Turinge and Tystberga parishes to Mrs. Kerstin Krumme to Åminne, the great hjel
2 CONC t Claës Christersson Horn's widow, received farms in Finland ; the very following year Mrs. Kerstin died, and Örboholm was inherited by her daughter Anna Horn, married to the Privy Councillor Count Mauritz Sture, also owner of Hör
2 CONC ningsholm, whose next owner until 1657 also held Örboholm; Thereafter this farm was owned by Johan Oxenstjerna's later wife, Margareta Brahe, remarried to Landgrave Fredrik af Hesse-Homburg. In 1662, Baron Sten Bjelke became the o
2 CONC wner of Örboholm, which was laid by him under Hufvudgården Gäddeholm, later called Thureholm, whose owner ever since held and still holds this manor. At least since 1849, Örboholra with underlaid ll/4 raw and pipe and 1 saved Ytte
2 CONC rvik (Uttervik) has constituted a belt of its own, which is now leased, but in addition Thureholm's present owner, chamberlain A. G. Bjelke, about 20 mtl (assessed at 420,000 rdr), in the same parish, partly under Thureholm and pa
2 CONC rtly leased to farmers. Örbobolm's manor, with a fairly substantial wooden dwelling house in 1818, was in 1865 assessed at 40,000 rdr riksmynt. On the homesteads Ekbonäs and Skillberga egor you can see the remains of a building, s
2 CONC ora in the 1600s was erected by Margareta Brahe on a new Örboholm built by her, but which soon burned, whereupon the manor freedom was lost.
2 CONT
