2 CONT * Married: '''Kerstin Christoffersdotter (Lilliehöök),''' died around 1640 (inheritance between the children was executed in 1641), daughter of Christoffer Jöransson ( Lilliehöök af Gälared och Kolbäck ) and Christina Pedersdotter
2 CONC  ( Store ).
2 CONT
