2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Gudmundsson (overview stab one, son of Nils Gunnesson Haal, knighted Gyllenhaal, Table 1), to Bråttensby equally mentioned parish and ribbing Berg Härene parish both Älvsborg. Born 1643. Cornet at Västgöta cavalry regiment 1677-01
2 CONC -23. Captain Lieutenant Darst. 1678-05-29. Farewell 1679 1 . Death 1701-03-01. Married to Beata Rosedufva in her second married (married 1: o before 1672 lieutenant Knut Wäsenberg, No. 672, 1676 death), death 1725-03-17, daughter 
2 CONC of the governor Carl SPARRE Rose dove No 190, and Ingeborg ribbing .
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn:
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl , born 1680. Sergeant at Skaraborg Regiment. Death 1700-02-08.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Christina , born 1685-03-25, dead 1739-08-10. Married 1722-12-02 with ensign Johan Botvid Gyllensting , No. 393, in his first marriage, born 1697, died 1752nd
2 CONT
2 CONT Metta , born 1691, died unmarried 1711-03-05.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis died as a child.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils died as a child
2 CONT
