2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Jan Raneke ; Swedish medieval weapons, p. 808
2 CONT * Nobility. ätten Svenske, No. 258 in Gabriel Anrep , Swedish nobility family tables (1858–1864), section 4
2 CONT * Medieval families in Sjuhärad - http://waslingmedia.se/borasiania/medeltida-atter-i-sjuharad/
2 CONT *  roskildehistorie.dk
