2 CONT Data henta fra http://vestraat.net/rossfjord-o/p111.htm#i11516
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Birgitte Nielsdatter (Steinbock)Benkestok was born in 1546 in Meløy, Nordland, Norway. She had one daughter with Jon Trondson Benkestokk of Meloy in 1580. She died in 1620 in Nordfjordeid, Sogn og Fjordane, Norway, at the age of 7
2 CONC 4.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jon Hallvardson Smør (fl. 1375) was a Norwegian nobleman. He was a son of the knight Hallvard Jonson Smør. In 1375, Jon was the ombudsman of king Haakon VI of Norway. He had two known children, the son Svale, and daughter Ulvhild 
2 CONC (whose granddaughter Birgitte married Trond Tordson Benkestok)
2 CONT
