2 CONT * Munch, Peter Andreas : History of the Norwegian people, 2. Main section, part 1, 1862
2 CONT * Munthe, Gerhard : "Heraldic-historical records", in Collections to the Norwegian People's Language and History, volume 4, 1836, p. 128–131
2 CONT * The Old Laws of Norway , Volume 3 and Series 2, Volume 1, 1904–1912
