2 CONT * Older Swedish salvation families I, p. 101
2 CONT * H. Gillingstam, Ätterna Oxenstierna and Vasa und medeltiden (1952), p. 47 f. and p. 739 with note 58
2 CONT * Halsten Petersson's family at roskildehistorie.dk
