1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Laurids (Lars) Jørgensen (Vognsen), til Strøm (c. 1560 – bef. 1627)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT A pivotal figure in the identification of the '''Vognsen af Stenshede''' lineage. His estates and legal standing provide conclusive evidence of the marriage between his grandfather, [https://www.geni.com/people/Lauritz-Vognsen/600
2 CONC 0000007255394401?through=5522265801180023798 '''Lasse Godskesen'''], and [https://www.geni.com/people/Dorthe-Thorlufsdatter-Bildt-of-Hassing-Hovgaard/6000000014674125113?through=6000000007255394401 '''Dorte Thorlufsdatter Bildt'''
2 CONC ].
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Parentage''': Son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Jørgen-Stenshede/6000000003421924369?through=6000000003421923296 '''Jørgen Lauridsen (Vognsen)'''] and his wife, ''N. Lauritsdatter''. His grandmother was '''Dorte Thorlufsdat
2 CONC ter Bildt''', whose lineage provided the basis for his major inheritance.
2 CONT * '''Inheritance of Hovgaard (1613)''': Following the death of the childless [https://www.geni.com/people/Henrik-Thorlufsen-Bildt-til-Hassing-Hovgård/6000000014673848946?through=6000000014674125113 '''Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt'''], 
2 CONC Laurids inherited the [https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 '''Vester Hassing Hovgaard'''] estate as his grand-nephew (the grandson of Henrik’s sister, Dorte). This confirms that his father, Jørge
2 CONC n Lauridsen, was born of Dorte Bildt’s first marriage to Lasse Godskesen Vognsen.
2 CONT * '''The 1629 Legal Dispute''': After Laurids' death (c. 1627), his estate was claimed by [https://www.geni.com/people/Knud-Knudsøn-til-Mosbjerggaard/6000000014764077548?through=6000000014674125113 '''Knud Knudsen Vunkesen (Leve)'
2 CONC ''], identified in records as his paternal uncle ([https://books.google.dk/books?id=A7pAAAAAYAAJ&hl=da&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=false '''Norske Rigsregistranter, vol. 1628-1634''']). Since Knud was Dorte Bildt’s son from her second 
2 CONC marriage, this legally solidifies the kinship between the Vognsen and Vunkesen lines through their common mother.
2 CONT * '''Family''': He was married to [https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Stråle-Dyre/6000000010531276618?through=6000000010531322554 '''Anna Pedersdatter Maaneskjold'''], reaffirming his high standing among the Dano-Norwegian nobility.
2 CONT * '''Daughter''': [https://www.geni.com/people/Kirsten-Lauridsdatter-Vognsen-til-Hassinggaard/6000000010591029291?through=6000000010531322554 '''Kirsten Lauridsdatter'''], who inherited shares of the '''Hovgaard''' estate after 16
2 CONC 27. Her mother is currently recorded as unknown (''N. N.'').
2 CONT * '''Status''': Owner of the '''Strøm''' estate in Norway and the '''Vester Hassing Hovgaard''' estate in Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT # '''Danmarks Adels Aarbog (DAÅ) 1936:2''', [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf pp. 94, 105-106].
2 CONT # '''Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift''' [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/900550.pdf 1989:2 (Dion S. E. Maaneskjold), p. 126].
2 CONT # '''Norske Rigsregistranter 1628-1634''', ed. O. G. Lundh, [https://books.google.dk/books?id=A7pAAAAAYAAJ&hl=da&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=false p. 186].
2 CONT # '''Kr. Værnfelt i JySaml'''. 5. Rk. III. 1937–38, [https://halsarkiv.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Det-gamle-Vester-Hassing.pdf p. 178].
2 CONT #  '''Trap Danmark'''. 5th Edition. Edited by N. Nielsen, P. Skautrup, and Povl Engelstoft. Vol. VI, 2: "Ålborg Amt". Article by C. Rise Hansen. ([https://trap5.lex.dk/sogn/vester-hassing-sogn-kaer-herred/#v_16_p_0984 History of V
2 CONC ester Hassing Hovgård and the 1613/1620 inheritance divisions]).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Død  	Ett 1626  til Strøm (Baahus len, Hjertun sogn) 1613, da han førte proces med Jon Christensen, brodersøn til Knud Knudsen Leve, til Olsnæs på Tjørn (Baahus) og Hassinggaard.<br/>
2 CONT Norske rigs-registranter tildeels i uddrag: bd. [https://books.google.dk/books?id=A7pAAAAAYAAJ&hl=da&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=false 1628-1634], ved O. G. Lundh 
2 CONT --
2 CONT Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1936:II:106.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I38262&tree=2 '''finnholbek.dk''']
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From DAA 1936 ([https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/927052.pdf p. 94]) we see that Lasse Godskesen [Vognsen af ​​Stenshede] was the husband of [https://www.geni.com/people/Dorthe-Thorlufsdatter-Bildt/6000000014674125113?through=6000000015
2 CONC 948596620 Dorthe Thorlufsdatter Bildt].
2 CONT She (Dorte), as follows from various sources, was the sister of Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt, who '''owned the estate Hovgaard ([http://www.gravstenogepitafier.dk/vesterhassing.htm Vester Hassing] Hovgaard)''' and died in 1613. As repo
2 CONC rted in the source [https://halsarkiv.dk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Det-gamle-Vester-Hassing.pdf Kr. Værnfelt i JySaml. 5. Rk. III. 1937–38, p. 178], after the death of Henrik B. (1613), '''Lars Jørgensen Vognsen''' became the own
2 CONC er of the Hovgaard estate, which after his (Lars') death, or perhaps earlier, was divided and went in shares to the inheritance of Lars's daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Kirsten-Lauridsdatter-Vognsen/6000000010591029291?thr
2 CONC ough=6000000010531322554 Kirsten Lauridsdatter], as well as his second wife, [https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Stråle-Dyre/6000000010531276618?through=6000000010531322554 Anna Pedersdatter Maaneskjold]. That is, based on the conte
2 CONC nt of this source, we can conclude that the Hovgaard estate was inherited around 1613 by Henrik Thorlufsen Bildt's grand-nephew ('''the grandson of his sister Dorte T. Bildt and, therefore, Lasse Godsesen Vognsen af Stenschede''')
2 CONC  - [https://www.geni.com/people/Lars-Jørgensen-Vognsen/6000000010531322554 Laurids Jørgensen (Stenshede)], who, as we already know, died ~ 1627, and whose inheritance was claimed (1629) by his paternal uncle, [https://www.geni.com
2 CONC /people/Knud-Knudsøn-til-Mosbjerggaard/6000000014764077548?through=6000000014674125113 Knud Knudsen (Leve)].
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT '''Personalhistorisk Tidsskrift. Samfundet for dansk genealogi og Personalhistorie. Årgang 109 1989:2. [https://slaegtsbibliotek.dk/900550.pdf S. 126, 129-130]''' 
2 CONT —————
2 CONT '''Laurids Jørgensen (Vognsen af Stenshede), til Strøm'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Född:	cirka 1555
2 CONT * Död:	cirka 1627 (63-79) Ström, Hjärtum, Bohuslän, Then Norway (Norge)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son till lagmann Jørgen Lauritsen 
2 CONT * Make till Wife 1 och Anna Pedersdotter Måneskiöld, till Ström 
2 CONT * Fader till Kirsten Lauridsdatter Vognsen, af Stenshede 
2 CONT * Halvbror till Anne Jørgensdatter  ----
