1 NOTE Herr Mogens Nielsen Lange  was born about 1410 in Hennegaard, Lydum, Vester Horne Herred, Ribe Amt, Denmark. He died on 25 Feb 1486. He married Sidsel Jepsdatter Juel about 1447 in Hennegaard, Ribe. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mogens was a Knight, the owner of Lydumgaard and the Bishop's Bailiff at Hennegård, named in 1454.
