1 NAME Tage Mogensen /Krabbe/
2 GIVN Tage Mogensen
2 _MARNM Krabbe
1 SEX M
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Friherre
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1553
